        <Text485 Ref="845" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.3,11.6,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>27daf6da5c104a32949b20689e0a447b</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text485</Name>
          <Page isRef="780" />
          <Parent isRef="780" />
          <Text>THAT THIS PERMIT SHALL BOT SERVE AS AN EXEMPTION FROM SECURING WRITTEN CLEARANCES FROM VARIOUS GOVERNMENT AUTHORITIES EXERCISING REGULATORY FUNCTION AFFECTING BUILDING/STRUCTURES.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text485>
        <Text486 Ref="846" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,11.8,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>3d501006586141e996e7d658ceb251d1</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text486</Name>
          <Page isRef="780" />
          <Parent isRef="780" />
          <Text>6)</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text486>
        <Text487 Ref="847" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.3,11.8,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>4d9ff7e94afe4a1198fa30e8687312e9</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text487</Name>
          <Page isRef="780" />
          <Parent isRef="780" />
          <Text>WHEN THE CONSTRUCTION IS UNDERTAKEN BY CONTRACT, THE WORK SHALL BE DONE BY A DULY LICENSED AND REGISTERED CONTRACTOR PURSUANT TO THE PRIVISIONS OF THE CONTRACTOR'S LICENSE LAW (RA4566)</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text487>
        <Text488 Ref="848" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,12,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>8d9f1942e2f8487ebed6c2b848dca98f</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text488</Name>
          <Page isRef="780" />
          <Parent isRef="780" />
          <Text>7)</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text488>
        <Text489 Ref="849" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.3,12,7.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>8a88571c96c14c75982ad31a9cfa7432</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
          <Name>Text489</Name>
          <Page isRef="780" />
          <Parent isRef="780" />
          <Text>THE OWNER/PERMITTEE SHALL SUBMIT A DULY ACCOMPLISHED PRESCRIBED 'NOTICE OF CONSTRUCTION' TO THE OFFICE OG THE BUILDING OFFICIAL PRIOR TO ANY CONSTRUCTION ACTIVITY.</Text>
          <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
          <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
          <Type>Expression</Type>
        </Text489>
        <Text490 Ref="850" type="Text" isKey="true">
          <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
          <ClientRectangle>0.1,12.2,0.2,0.2</ClientRectangle>
          <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
          <Font>Arial,7</Font>
          <Guid>77672023038146239bf2e8b2486f0740</Guid>
          <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
